%% Figure: Post-resolution verification and rejection-review workflow.
%% Render to: Images/Chapter 3/post-resolution-workflow.png
flowchart TD
    A["Authority submits a solution or a rejection"] --> B{"Which action?"}
    B -- Solution --> C["Report enters PendingVerification"]
    B -- Rejection --> D["Report enters PendingRejectionReview"]
    C --> E["Citizens inspect the fix and cast a verification vote"]
    D --> F["Citizens review the rejection and cast an appeal vote"]
    E --> G{"Community accepts the solution?"}
    G -- Yes --> H["Closed"]
    G -- No --> I["Reopened"]
    F --> J{"Community upholds the rejection?"}
    J -- Yes --> H
    J -- No --> I
    I --> K["Authority restarts work"]
